window.products.push({"id":293023,"name":"DYNMC you Trifold Mattress - Folding Mattress w/Carry Bag - Trifold Memory Foam Mattress, Soft Oeko-TEX Cover - Perfect Portable Guest Bed, Travel Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8165dzE6NEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you ready to stand out as a host? Now you are! You'll leave an excellent impression on your overnight guests as soon as you present the tri-folding mattress by DYNMC YOU - softer, superior in quality & definitely more stylish than the old-fashioned air mattress, an ordinary single bed mattress or the rigid fold up bed! The memory foam guest mattress is foldable - simply brilliant if you only have little space or no extra guest bed! Always ready at hand & space-saving storage: Whether you're accommodating guests or planning a sleepover at someone’s home, fold out foam mattress is your trusty sleeping buddy! Thanks to the handy carrying bag you can easily transport the guest floor mattress and also store it safely & compactly Feeling good & sleeping comfortably - even as a guest: Ultimate sleeping comfort even on a floor mattress to fold, something we have backed up with diligent tests! We are topping a 4” thick foam layer with an additional 1.5” premium memory foam layer - extremely cozy, medium firmness & guaranteed not to get saggy up to 250lbs; your top-notch portable guest beds! A trendy design that's easy on the eyes: Wow, what an eye candy with its cool Scandinavian vibe, featuring a snow-white sleeping surface and dark gray touches! The practical anti-slip bottom makes sure that the folding memory foam mattress stays firmly in place - flying mats are better off in dreams! Always in top condition & well prepared for the next guest: Has your overnight companion left already? Easily remove the allergy-friendly, OEKO-TEX certified cover (made of a cotton-polyester-spandex mix) in no time via the extra-long zipper and wash hygienically at 30°C! In the twinkling of an eye, the trifold memory foam mattress will be all set for you to plan another sleepover party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8165dzE6NEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYNMC you","source_asin":"B085S36YWS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085S36YWS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085S36YWS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
