window.products.push({"id":293134,"name":"16th Birthday Photo Booth Props by PartyGraphix. DIY 16th Birthday Party Props Kit (34 Count, Black and Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PJ88Yy-oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Included in the kit of sweet 34 pieces you will find props like champagne flutes, witch you are not required 21 years to take photos with, fabulous red lips, fancy glasses, party hats, hipster mustaches and many more. The wide range of both masculine and feminine props makes this DIY photo booth prop kit an excellent choice for any 16th birthday that targets the true sweetness of a birthday party. To assemble all you need to do is to use the included double-sided adhesive tabs to attach the wooden sticks to the props, before displaying them by your photo booth or leave the wooden sticks off to use them as black and gold fabulous 16th birthday party decorations.  PartyGraphix produces original prop designs for all types of party themes. All creative designs are original and should not be associated with any other brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PJ88Yy-oL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartyGraphix","source_asin":"B01N5OQXOB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5OQXOB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5OQXOB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293135,"name":"Kitchen Knife Sharpener Professional 2 Stage Steel Diamond Ceramic Coated Sharpening Tool Cook Chef Knife Sharpening Kit Easy to Use Extremely Quickly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HWuj-bB3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This easy-to-use knife sharpener is poised to become a must-have in your kitchens. Be you a green hand or a master chef, this sharpener will allow you to enjoy the fun of cooking. A blunt knife can be one of the most dangerous things in your kitchen.  Blades not sharp enough cannot cut or chop food properly, and may even cut your skin or fingers if slipped. Fortunately, our knife sharpener can free you from any of those worries.   This new type of knife sharpener is designed based on knife-sharpening experiences from thousands of chefs. It is quicker and easier to use with higher level of safety and comfort.  With just a few pulls through the 2 stages, your blade can get razor-sharpness.  “Coarse sharpening” uses solid tungsten carbide to easily recover the V-shape for the dullest knife.  “Fine sharpening” cleans the burrs and polishes the blade for refined sharpness.  We are providing a high-quality knife sharpener with strong ABS plastics and 304 stainless steels, making it highly durable.  If you are not 100% satisfied, you can immediately return the product and ask for a full refund.  For any questions, please email us, we’ll get back to you within 24 hours. Still troubled by the dullness of your knifes? Click the “orange button” to add your cart and place order now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HWuj-bB3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flyouky","source_asin":"B079KCKSP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079KCKSP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079KCKSP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
