window.products.push({"id":293147,"name":"Exclusive Home Catarina Layered Solid Room Darkening Blackout and Sheer Grommet Top Curtain Panel Pair, 52\"x108\", Black Pearl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Qu1-vZb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Add luxury to any room with the Exclusive Home Catarina Layered Solid Room Darkening Blackout and Sheer Grommet Top Curtain Panels. These curtain panels offer a sateen woven room darkening blackout curtain paired with a sheer panel for layered elegance. They are interwoven with room darkening blackout insulation provided by LightBlock and Thermax technology that blocks light, provides privacy and energy efficient. Constructed with matte silver grommets, they can be hung on a curtain rod up to 1.25\" diameter. Suitable for any window space. From the Manufacturer Exclusive Home is North America's leading supplier of home textiles, ready-made drapery, and window curtain hardware. We provide superbly crafted products that are affordable, yet luxurious, and are unsurpassed in quality and construction. Our window treatments are designed with timeless beauty in mind. We deliver high fashion designs and patterns, varying textures and fabrics, as well as a myriad of colors that today's discerning consumers expects. Exclusive Home window treatments are available in an array of fabric constructions including jacquard, linen, burlap, sheer, thermal/blackout, silk, faux silk, polyester, poly blends, cotton, and cotton blends. These fabric constructions are offered in varying designs and colors including classic solids, prints, textures, thickness, lengths, widths, and burnouts. Our window hardware is designed for that perfect finishing touch. You will find our window decor designs to be contemporary styles blended with timeless beauty to add a sophisticated feel to any room. Constructed from durable iron metal with various color finishes, our window hardware is sure to last a lifetime. From classic to contemporary designs and today's top fashion trends, you are sure to find that Exclusive Home textiles, drapery and window hardware will fit any look, mood, or style. Like millions of customers already have, let our designs be the anchor for each room in your home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Qu1-vZb8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exclusive Home Curtains","source_asin":"B0B296KJJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B296KJJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B296KJJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293148,"name":"60-Minute Visual Timer, 3 Inch Kitchen Timer, Classroom Analog Countdown Clock, Time Management Tool for Kids and Adults, Time Timers for Teaching, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLlH9QtoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Procrastination, Bad implementation capacity, Game addiction, Poor efficiency of learning & work? ◕‿◕Don't worry！Our Visual Timers are great tools for your time management! ►Kids timer can help parents improve the efficiency of their children's tasks, such as brushing teeth, dressing, and tidying the room. It can also supervise children's time in learning and games. ►It can help teachers effectively allocate students' class time. It is also an excellent assistant for managing office work time and kitchen cooking. ►After starting the timer, there will be regular ticking sounds, which is very suitable for events that require a countdown and add atmosphere to them, such as debates and sports. (There will be a ticking sound for 10 seconds after the ringing, which is normal.) ►When the pointer rotates, it brings out a round of eye-catching green pieces, the time is clear at a glance. ►This 60 minute visual timer is fully mechanical, meaning you never have to worry about replacing batteries.  ►The cute outlook and the fresh color outlook spice up any space, which is pleasant to the mood. 💖 Warm Tips:📣 ❶The first step can only be turned clockwise. ❷To activate the timer before each use, turn the control knob clockwise to the 55-minute position, then turn it counterclockwise to the desired time. (This operation is to wind up enough clockwork, then trigger a 3-5 second bell.) ❸If you want to turn off the alarm, only need to rotate the green disk a little bit, then return to 0 scale immediately. ❹Do not rotate the green disk clockwise beyond 0 position amount, This may cause product damage. Product Parameters Size: 3.1\" X 2.7\"X0.78\" weight: 185g/0.4 lb Type: Mechanical inner core (no battery required) Countdown Time: 60 minutes or less","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tLlH9QtoS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AriCoCo","source_asin":"B093C15FR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C15FR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C15FR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
