window.products.push({"id":293225,"name":"danila-souvenirs Faberge style Lilies of the Valley Egg / Trinket Jewel Box 3.4'' (8.5 cm) pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qVaK3y+4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This egg is a replica of the famous Lilies of the Valley Fabergé Egg. The Lilies of the Valley Eg is a jewelled Fabergé egg made under the supervision of the Russian jeweller Peter Carl Fabergé in 1898 by Fabergé ateliers. The supervising goldsmith was Michael Perchin. The egg is one of the two eggs in the Art Nouveau style. It was presented on April 5 to Emperor Nicholas II, who gave it as a gift to Empress Alexandra Fyodorovna. The egg can be used as a trinket jewel box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qVaK3y+4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"danila-souvenirs","source_asin":"B01N571E9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N571E9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N571E9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293226,"name":"Flexzion Mandoline Slicer Adjustable Stainless Steel Built-in Blades for Slicing Food Vegetable Onion Potato Chip French Fry Apple Tomato Zucchini Noo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RF38xS0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mandoline slicers get pretty heavy use in restaurant kitchens, where they're helpful for very quickly creating uniform slices, such as vegetables for salads, potatoes for chips and sticks for things like French fries. In the case of hot dishes, such carbon-copy cuts also help ensure even cooking. That's particularly important with something like a potato chip, where inconsistencies of thickness would lead to a batch of chips that are half undercooked and half burnt to a crisp. We like the fact that all of the blades are secured by a locking system. Because this mandoline is extra wide, you get a stainless steel slicing deck that makes food glide easily over it when you secure the safety hand guard. Also, the safety hand guard is going to secure food in a stable position for slicing. There are also non-skid feet which fold for a more compact storage option. There’s nothing more important to a kitchen aficionado than well-cut fruits and vegetables. This slicer is the perfect solution for getting the well-cut foods that you crave. This device allows you to slice cut all your favorite foods with different slicing thicknesses to choose from. All in all, this is a top rated mandoline for good reason. It cuts food to perfection, giving you an excellent presentation of your meals. It also does this safely, so there’s no threat of getting fingers caught in the appliance. Give your meals the wonderful style and aesthetics that you crave with this great cutting tool. Specification: Measures 16.5 x 5.25 x 5.25 inches Measures 16.5 x 5.25 x 5.25 inches Package Content: 1x Kitchen Mandoline Food Slicer Adjustable Stainless Steel For Slicing Food Vegetable Slicer Onion Potato Slicer Tomato Slicer Vegetable Chip Cutter French Fry Cutter Julienne Cutter Cooking 1x Kitchen Mandoline Food Slicer Adjustable Stainless Steel For Slicing Food Vegetable Slicer Onion Potato Slicer Tomato Slicer Vegetable Chip Cutter French Fry Cutter Julienne Cutter Cooking","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RF38xS0+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B073RSTQYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073RSTQYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073RSTQYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293227,"name":"Bestpresso Espresso Machine Single Serve Coffee Maker, Compatible with Nespresso Orignial. Programmable Buttons for Espresso Pods. Premium Italian 19 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BJBo6DRCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ITALIAN CAPSULE COFFEE MACHINE, APPROVED BY BARISTA: Our Bestpresso Pro machine can make barista-style coffee every time, extracting the delicate flavor of each coffee capsule to perfection. Even though this machine is comparable, it is built unlike any other, and has a very high 19 BAR pressure pump made in Italy. COMPATIBLE WITH ORIGINALLINE NESPRESSO CAPSULES: This machine is designed for use with our brand espresso pods but is also compatible with the original line capsules. Need for Speed: No need to wait for your morning cup of coffee. Start your day the right way with our modernly designed and made Capsule Coffee Machine. Our Nespresso machine has a quick heat-up technology that reaches the ideal temperature in 25-30 seconds. CLEANING IS HASSLE-FREE: The capsule container, drip tray, and 0.8-liter water tank are removable for quick and easy cleaning. Our machine is ideal for taller glass recipes because of the folding cup tray. ENERGY-SAVING AUTOMATIC FEATURE: If you ever forget to switch your Bestpresso machine off, no need to worry! After 9 minutes of inactivity, the machine's automated energy-saving function shuts it down. Not to mention that this time frame can be extended to 30 minutes, making your life easier by eliminating unnecessary worries. Furthermore, its user-friendly and the variety of style will complement any modern kitchen decor. We know everything there is to know about home espresso machines! LOVE IT OR GET YOUR MONEY BACK: Here at Bestpresso, your satisfaction is the heart of our mission. So, if you’re not satisfied with your purchase for any reason, contact us, we'll make it right. The 1-YEAR WARRANTY that comes with your Bestpresso Single Serve Coffee Machine protects you. To avoid losing or breaking parts, please handle with care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BJBo6DRCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestpresso","source_asin":"B09Z5ZLM6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z5ZLM6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z5ZLM6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
