window.products.push({"id":293286,"name":"ATMOZ (2-Pack E17 New Longer 152-LED Dimmable Warm White 110/120v Microwave & Appliance Compatible Bulb.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVbdj8WKL._AC_.jpg","description":"NEW! Longer bulb (2.5 inches) with 152 LEDs for brighter even light. Fits microwaves where shorter or longer Base E17 appliance bulbs are used  Could be used in over the range microwaves like Whirlpool and other brands. It is Dimmable when used with LED compatible dimmers. Refer to your manufacurer manuals to see if it is compatible. Features: Very low power consumption (3.5W instead of 40W) Surface light bulb illuminates the surface below the microwave Replaces or can be used instead of: 8206232A, AP4512653, 8206232, 1890433, AH2376034, EA2376034, PS2376034 and others. Can be used where short (2 inches like 8206232A) or longer 2.5/3.0 inch bulbs (like GE WB36X10003 and LG 6912W1Z004B) are used Specifications: Base Type: E17 Intermediate  Power: 3.5W  Quantity: 152 (brighter than 64 & 80 LED versions) LED Color: Warm White (2700K-3000K)  Lifetime: More than 40,000 hours  Luminous (lm): 400 LM (~40W equivalent)  Base Diameter: 17mm (~0.6 inches)  Length: 2.5 inches (63 mm)  Angle: 360°  Certification: CE, RoHS Notes: 1) Please use LED dimmer / SCR IR Dimmer (Silicon Controlled Rectifier Infrared Dimmer) to improve flicker and power reduction.Ordinary dimmers are mainly used to control incandescent lamps. Most of the microwaves use ordinary dimmers and therefore a slight flicker might occur in the Low setting. 2) Some microwaves will have a very little current flowing even in the OFF position of the light switch. If your microwave is one of those, then the LED bulb will glow slightly even in the OFF position. Warning: This is to be used only on the exterior of microwave (the one that gives light to the stove top). Do NOT use it inside the microwave or inside the range or anywhere where direct heat comes ATMOZ and Atmoz are trademarks of Leames Selections LLC.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aVbdj8WKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATMOZ","source_asin":"B01I7BFE40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01I7BFE40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01I7BFE40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
