window.products.push({"id":293360,"name":"Granbest Modern Couch Cover Stylish Pattern Sofa Covers for 3 Cushion Couch Durable Furniture Protector 1-Piece Sofa Slipcover with Non-Slip Foam Elas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FdmPP75HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE COMFORT: Granbest stretch sofa cover is crafted by super soft fabric with a innovative exclusive pattern. Its unique and stylish design bring a brand new luxurious atmosphere to your house. The exquisite workmanship and thick fabric make our couch covers more durable, skin-friendly and breathable, providing you with a quality experience. PERFECT FIT: Our magic sofa covers are made of high-quality and high-elastic fabric (95% polyester fiber and 5% spandex). Due to its high elasticity, the sofa slipcover can completely cover various types of sofas.Tuck the foam rolls into the sides around the cushion. It will keep the extra fabric in place and elastic hem will make our couch slipcover fit firmly. Please measure your sofa before purchasing. FURNITURE PROTECTER: Our couch covers are made of durable and thicken fabric. These characteristics of our furniture covers ensure that it can effectively protect your sofa from pet scratches and prevent pet hair from sticking to it. Besides, it can prevent accidental stains and damage. Very suitable for houses with cats, dogs and other pets. A low-cost easy and efficient way to transform your old sofa to a brand new sofa. EASY AND QUICK INSTALLATION: Locate the \"back\" tags on the inner hem and place the slipcovers on the left and right back corners of the sofa. Beginning from the back side, make it cover the whole sofa. And then, move the slipcover slowly in order to fit the sofa better. Tuck the foam roller in to get the best anti-slip effect.Finally, arrange the whole cover without wrinkles. Then, installation completes. We also provide detailed and simple installation diagrams to help you. EASY CARE: These universal couch covers are machine washable. Please wash in cold water at a gentle cycle with a neutral lotion. Please line dry and do not bleach or iron.If you have any questions about our products, please contact us, we will be pleased to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FdmPP75HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granbest","source_asin":"B09CSZ4RHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CSZ4RHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CSZ4RHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
