window.products.push({"id":293409,"name":"Household 100% Cotton Jersey Knit Fitted Sheet Set 3 Piece, King Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillow Cases（ Light Coffee King）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYi7MY56L._AC_.jpg","description":"Package Content: King size Fitted sheet 76\"x80\"+12\" with 2 pillowcase (20\"x36\"). Advantage: Our fitted sheet set woven with pre-dyed yarn with a combed cotton heathered effect. Washing is not easy to fade. The comfort and breathability of our cotton are more than that of microfiber. Deep pocket fitted sheet with elastic all around fits mattresses up to 12\" Style: simple yet sophisticated. We provide colorful mattress protector. Elegant color brings a fresh look to your bedroom. Care Instruction: Wash in cold water with similar colors. Tumble dry low heat. Easy care. Service: Our NO.1 goal is to provide you with the ultimate best customer service in the world and make you a lifetime happy customer, shop happy and confident with our 5-star satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYi7MY56L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H HOUSEHOLD","source_asin":"B07KFSJSWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KFSJSWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KFSJSWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293410,"name":"FASTNOVA 12x16 inch White Real Solid Wood Picture Photo Poster Print Art Frame Made to Display Picture 8x12 with Mat or 12x16 Without Mat, Wall Mounti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RwfRF6mhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"1. The two sides of acrylic sheet are covered with protective film, Please all torn off when use! 2. Wall Mounting Material Included: Black S hook and White non-trace nail . 3. The black S hook : It has been installed on the back of the picture frame. When Hanging the picture frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail : It is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the picture frame, conveniently and quickly. 5.The frame is 2 cm Wide 2 cm Thick, 13 x 17 inch is the outside dimension of the photo frame, not the dimension of the photo. 6. 12 x 16 inch is the dimension of the photo that can be displayed without mat. Photos that are larger than or less than 12 x 16 inch can not be used without mat on the print frame. 7. Because the dimension of the accurate opening of the mat is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), the display dimension of any size picture on the poster frame is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), which is about 8 x 12. So 8 x 12 inch is the minimum dimension of the photo that can be displayed with mat. 8. The unmarked nail can not be used on hard walls such as tile and marble.if you want to use, please use electric drill and screw. 9. Can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. 10. Great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, company and school projects. 11. Good art frames Solutions at gallery. 12. Have 3-5 mm size measurement error, please careful purchase if particularly mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RwfRF6mhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASTNOVA","source_asin":"B07DXYT98V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DXYT98V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DXYT98V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293411,"name":"SUNNYPARK Christmas Tree Collar, 23'' D Handmade Artificial Rattan Wicker Christmas Stand Tree Collar Basket Base Cover for Holiday Decoration-Round B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lAW5+HYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Tree Collar with Unique Design】 Handmade Artificial Rattan Wicker Christmas tree collar is an inventive alternative to traditional tree skirts. The woven Christmas tree stand collar looks with natural, handcrafted warmth. Simply place the bottomless ring over your stand and secure your tree inside. Breaks it down for convenient storage. 【Dimensions of this Christmas Tree Basket】 Please carefully consider dimensions and make sure you have at least 9” clearance from the ground to the lowest branch of your tree. The diameter of tree stand must be less than 23”. This Christmas tree stand cover fits most standard size Christmas trees, especially for pencil Christmas tree. 【Easy to Assemble】 Our Christmas tree stand collar comes with 4 panels and assembles in just minutes, no need for screws. Dress up the base of your tree, it will hide your unsightly bucket or stand and add extra style to the grand Christmas tree this year. If you have small size tree base, just remove 1 panel for a triangle size. 【Durable and Versatile】 This Xmas tree collar is made of PE and metal material, as real Rattan Wicker. It masterfully woven by hand. It is fully washable and waterproof. Hiding your Christmas tree base and protecting it by this tree collar ring. Choose from our four colors of brown, gray, white and golden. 【Christmas Tree Decoration】 Perfect replacement for your traditional Christmas Tree skirt by this rustic Christmas tree collar. Create a unique look for your Christmas tree this year with this Christmas tree base cover. It also helps to discourage pets & small children from accessing bottom of tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lAW5+HYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNYPARK","source_asin":"B0997R7G4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0997R7G4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0997R7G4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
