window.products.push({"id":293701,"name":"Howard Miller Candice Mantel Clock 635-131 – Americana Cherry Home Decor with Quartz, Dual-Chime Movement and Volume Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mC3fWBgfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MANTEL CLOCK: The Candice Mantel Clock features an Americana Cherry finish on select hardwoods and veneers to compliment your home decor. Place it above your fireplace in the living room for a decorative piece with wood columns on all four corners and elegant burl on the front and top panels. DURABLE: This beautiful clock has a sturdy wood frame to relieve stress in a busy household. This timepiece has a unique polished brass-finished cylindrical pendulum, a polished brass-finished bezel, Arabic numerals, front beveled glass, and black hands to stand out over the off-white dial. CHIMES: Easily tell time with dual-chime movement that plays Westminster or Ave Maria chime to strike each hour with an option to play on ¼, ½, and ¾ as well. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off and convenient volume control to have anywhere in your house. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 11.5 inches (29 cm), with a width of 9.75 inches (25 cm) and a depth of 4.75 inches (12 cm). Powered and operated by quartz, dual-chime movement, it requires two C sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mC3fWBgfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B08ZJPKMRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJPKMRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJPKMRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
