window.products.push({"id":293764,"name":"Baking Sheet Set of 3 (9/12/16 Inch), Zacfton Stainless Steel Cookie Sheet Baking Pan Toaster Oven Cooking Trays Pans for Baking, Non Toxic & Healthy,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VankdeRxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Zacfton stainless steel baking sheets are made of 18/0 stainless steel without chemical coating or any other materials, they're healthful and safe for your daily use, protecting your family health. No more aluminum into your food, great replacement to aluminum pan. The superior mirror finish for easy and effortless clean up. Why you choose stainless steel oven pan 1. Stainless steel is more healthier and non-toxic than aluminum 2. Stainless steel is dishwasher-safe, but aluminum not 3. Stainless steel is more easier to clean even in hand-wash 4. Stainless steel, food cook more evenly, less stick Dimension: Length 9 x Width 7 x Height 1 inchLength 12 x Width 10 x Height 1 inchLength 16 x Width 12 x Height 1 inch Material: 18/0 stainless steel  Color: sliver Weight: 1375g Package Included: 1* Baking sheet Length 9 x Width 7 x Height 1 inch 1* Baking sheet Length 12 x Width 10 x Height 1 inch 1* Baking sheet Length 16 x Width 12 x Height 1 inch Notice: 1. Please use soft cleaning rag to clean the sheets for the beauty of its surface. 2. Please clean and dry the baking pan after using for its durability. 3. Make more delicious,have a happy baking time. TIP for Stainless Steel 🌸1. You can use a light spray or grease the pan with a little oil or butter to avoid food stick.🌸2. It is normal for the baking pan to warp due to uneven heating, and it can be restored to its original state after cooling, without affecting the use. To avoid this phenomenon, you can preheat the pan and add your food after the pan is hot. After-sale Service: 100% SATISFACTION -- if for any reason you don't love it, let us know and we'll refund your order no-questions-asked, 90 days return and money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VankdeRxL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zacfton","source_asin":"B07G22XWB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G22XWB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G22XWB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293765,"name":"Full Size Sheet Set - 4 Piece - Hotel Luxury Bed Sheets - Cotton Printed Sheets - Wrinkle Free, Cooling, Extra Soft & Durable - Easy Care - Deep Pocke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CetQ4E64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY STYLING as you can choose from 10 beautiful solid dyed colors for versatility or add pops of color. Classics of white, cream, (fawn) taupe, light gray, dark gray or navy blue cover the basic sheet set colorways to coordinate with most bedding sets and home decor. Eye catching colorways of aqua, coral, yellow and red provide pops of color for fun affordable fashion. These great colorways make these sheet sets perfect housewarming or graduation gifts. MUST HAVE FEATURES so you can relax and unwind. These sheet sets are blended with a soft cotton and durable polyester to keep these sheets from breaking down quickly. The fitted sheet was made to boost your beauty sleep by keeping sheets snug in place all night. The all-around elastic band and deep pockets fit up to a 16” mattress height. Pair these sheets with the Carter Comforter or Cozy Duvet Set from Welspun Basics to complete a must have look (each sold separately). QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, machine wash cold, normal cycle with like colors. Do not bleach or dry clean, tumble dry low. Warm iron if needed. These sheets feature a blend of 60% cotton and 40% polyester making them highly durable, wrinkle-resistant, and extremely soft to the touch. The 220 thread-count creates the perfect sleeping environment. Cool and crisp, this lightweight collection will keep you soundly sleeping all night long. DESIGNED WITH CARE for both you and the planet. We use cotton which is better for the environment.  Unlike other bedding sheet sets that use 100% plastic microfibers that is toxic and harmful to both humans and the planet. We also offer extended size range that covers all your bedding needs. Our Twin XL is the perfect college dorm room sheets while our queen size covers your Guest Bedroom sheet sets. Available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King, California King. PERFECT FIT Fitted sheets feature an all-around elastic for easy placement and less movement on the bed for a guaranteed snuggly sleep. Fits mattresses up to 16” deep. Full set includes 1 flat sheet (81” x 96”) 1 fitted sheet (54” x 76”) 2 standard pillowcases (20” x 30”). Stylish upturned hem on the flat sheet and pillowcases adds visual interest to this classic sheet set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CetQ4E64L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Welhome","source_asin":"B09HQX27DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HQX27DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HQX27DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
