window.products.push({"id":293976,"name":"Chic Home BCS18717-AN Hortense 8 Piece Comforter and Quilt Set Hotel Collection Design Fish Scale Pattern Bedding - Decorative Pillows Shams Included,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQakCcKMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give your bedroom a bold new look with the unique style of the Hortense comforter and quilt set from Chic Home. This set includes a stylish two-tone hotel collection design comforter and a fish scale pattern quilt, giving you the freedom to mix and match as you please. Two unique decorative pillows and four design coordinated shams complete the look. Specifications: • Size: King • Color Scheme: Navy • Piece Count: 8 • Set Includes: • 1pc Hotel Collection Comforter (104” x 90”) • 1pc Fish Scale Quilt (104” x 90”) • 2pc Hotel Collection Pillow Shams (20” x 36” + 2”) • 2pc Quilted Fish Scale Pillow Shams (20” x 36” + 2”) • 1pc Helix Embroidered Decorative Pillow (18” x 18”) • 1pc Two Tone Stitched Decorative Pillow (12” x 18”) • Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, hypoallergenic synthetic down alternative filling Fabric and Design: • Silky soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material • Fashion forward hotel collection design comforter and fish scale pattern quilt Features: • Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning • Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials • Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQakCcKMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B08D4PXNJ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D4PXNJ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D4PXNJ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":293977,"name":"MIU France Oval Cutting/Serving Board with Stainless Steel Band and Handle, Brown, 12\" x 20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712kGvutDcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great for entertaining, this MIU serving board is made out of the finest side grain bamboo is large enough to fit a whole roast, ham or turkey. Stainless steel banding enhances the beauty of the board, and stainless steel handles make it easy to carry directly to the table for a fabulous presentation and at-the-table carving. Its edges are grooved to catch the drippings. This MIU cutting board is also a great way to serve breads and cheeses for parties. Bamboo is an excellent alternative to wood: equally beautiful and sturdy, it is without the high cost of harvesting, and unlike wood, bamboo is very quick to grow and harvest. This makes bamboo a much more superior choice over wood, which can take years or decades to mature. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth and dry immediately. Do not put in dishwasher or immerse in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712kGvutDcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIU France","source_asin":"B00833PFXI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00833PFXI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00833PFXI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
