window.products.push({"id":293987,"name":"Merryshop Silent Digital 6\" Alarm Clock with Date and Temperature Display, Repeating Snooze, Light-Activated Sensor Light and Touch-Activated Nightlig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sPQYk6KSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Perfect Nightstand, Bedside or Office Desk Alarm Clock! Clock doesn't light up in the day time, unless you touch the top SNOOZE/LIGHT button to activate nightlight. Clock is featured with soft sensor light and bright nightlight.  INSTRUCTION: (Guide video available) Insert 3 AAA batteries or connect it into wall outlet (DC 5V). You'll hear long beeping. TIME SET: Push bar to the end, TIME SET. You can see time flashes on display: ready to be set. Push bar to LOCK to confirm your setting. Press HOUR and MIN to adjust. DATE SET: Push bar on DATE SET position. Year, month and date flashes on display. Press YEAR, MONTH and DATE to adjust. Push bar to LOCK to confirm. ALARM SET: AL.SET is to set alarm. AL.ON and AL.OFF is to control alarm status. Push bar on AL.SET position. Alarm flashes on display. Press HOUR and MIN to adjust. Push bar to LOCK to confirm. After alarm setting, do remember to push the left bar to AL.ON. At this time, alarm is on and will go off. You can see 2 little marks between hour and minute. It can be 12-hour time or 24-hour time. Temperature C/F: Press MIN/DATE to alternate between Celsius and Fahrenhite. Sensor: Turn on/off Sensor via the switch button on the back. Sensor gives off soft light to help you see time from short distance hands free. Nightlight and snooze: Touch the top of the clock to activate snooze and nightlight.  Package: 1x Alarm Clock （No battery and data cables）","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sPQYk6KSL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merryshop","source_asin":"B00PVC6FO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-293987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PVC6FO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PVC6FO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
